# Hero miniatures rendered from third-party 3D models (scripts/figures/).
# Licence gate, unbrewed-p2p-879: a local render must never ship by accident.
# The `vercel` CLI uploads the working tree and ignores .gitignore, so this is
# the file that keeps public/figures/ off a deploy. Serving figures is an
# explicit opt-in — see "Serving figures on a deploy" in
# scripts/figures/README.md.
# The committed open-licence set, /public/figures-open (unbrewed-p2p-903), is
# NOT ignored: it ships everywhere. The rule below is anchored and exact, so
# it matches the private folder only.
/public/figures
